# Every run folder records a hash of the exact bytes of the Python files under sfr/
# (sfr/provenance.py, code_sha256). Git must therefore store and check out these files
# byte for byte on every platform, with no line-ending conversion, so that anyone who
# clones the repository can reproduce the hash written in runs/*/provenance.json.
sfr/**/*.py -text
# The one-patient tool reports a hash of its own code and of each artifact card; keep their bytes as written
sfrtool/**/*.py -text
scripts/predict_patient.py -text
artifacts/** -text
